# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of the root .dockerignore for this image.
# The root file only excludes top-level bin/obj; a working tree that has been built (a dev box,
# the test box) carries hundreds of MB of nested bin/obj that must not be shipped to the builder.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
.git/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
**/node_modules/
mobile/
desktop/
tests/
docs/
installers/
data/
*.log
*.onnx
